            <div xml:id="d167">

                <pb facs="0700" n="688" sameAs="frus:frus1946v04/pg688"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">C.P.(Gen)Doc.1.E.7.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article 41</hi></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-outside-research" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1946-10-15T23:59:59+01:00" notBefore="1946-07-29T00:00:00+01:00"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>Add to the text of Article 41, paragraph 1<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>, the
                    following: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>… “But Italy may maintain or build permanent fortifications, situated at
                            a distance not less than 20 kms from the frontier, solely for the
                            purpose of ensuring the defence of her territory.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
            </div>
